WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Pip accepts one responsibility.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Bramble hands over a small task scroll.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The scroll unfolds across the floor
and out the door.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Is that still one responsibility?

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
It is one scroll.
